      "content": "whispering to the dark won't change anything. it's just a slow way to die and it hurts so much. i'm looking at the sky and it's just empty. it feels like the world is finally finishing itself off, and i'm just stuck in the middle of it, suffering for no reason. wouldn't it be easier if things just... ended? if i could just stop feeling everything?",
